<section id="section-3-1-developer-experience-(dx)" class="flex flex-col mt-(--spacing-lg) gap-y-(--spacing-sm) scroll-mt-(--spacing-md)"><h2 class="text-(--custom-color-header) scroll-mt-(--spacing-md) [--inline-code-border:] [--inline-code-px:var(--spacing-xs)] [--inline-code-aside-ps:none] [--inline-code-mx:0.1em] break-words font-bold text-4xl mb-(--spacing-sm)">Developer Experience (DX)</h2><p>I wrote 2 versions of Bubble Sort using both indexing schemes, and it is <span class="italic me-1">objectively</span> clear which is <strong class="text-(--custom-color-accent) font-bold">less prone to off-by-one errors</strong> which stems from the reason it is <span class="italic me-1">easier to understand</span>.</p></section>
