<section id="section-25-1-conclusion" class="flex flex-col mt-(--spacing-lg) gap-y-(--spacing-sm) scroll-mt-(--spacing-md)"><h2 class="text-(--custom-color-header) scroll-mt-(--spacing-md) [--inline-code-border:] [--inline-code-px:var(--spacing-xs)] [--inline-code-aside-ps:none] [--inline-code-mx:0.1em] break-words font-bold text-4xl mb-(--spacing-sm)">Conclusion</h2><p>We have successfully migrated our controllers that were using a simple JavaScript <span class="italic me-1">array of objects</span> as storage to a proper SQLite-powered database with all the convenience and data protection that it provides. Moreover we did that without introducing any regression bugs.</p></section>
