<p>Current Working Directory is <code class="[word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] inline-block font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--bg-base-200))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--custom-color-text))] px-(--spacing-xs)">30-days-of-node-api-dev</code></p>
